[Bl]azer is five-passenger, two-row crossover[ that] fits between the compact[ Equ]in[ox] and three[-]row Traverse.
[It] is attractive[ –] much better[ looking] – than the original, and displays[ far][ superior] road manners[.][ Its] smooth and quiet[ ride] is a credit to un[ib]ody construction, instead[ of][ the][ old] body[-]on-[frame]. It[�][�]s[ also] more fuel-efficient[,][ thanks] to stop/start technology[,][ cylinder] deactivation in[ the] V6 and a smooth-shifting nine-[speed][ automatic][ that] always seems to know the right gear.[
